  "scope": "Complete unmodified PlayerSaver.kt and PlayerSaveParser.kt, including populate/save/parse/parseData/runContentHooks and real save-file I/O in owned temporary directories with file.encoding=UTF-8. Also complete unmodified VarpManager, JSONUtils, PersistPlayer, GraveType, GameAttributes, SavedData/ActivityData/QuestData/GlobalData, IronmanManager/IronmanMode, SpellBookManager, BodyPart, Gender, MusicEntry and PetDetails, and the complete original timer and Item/Container classes of the timers and inventory oracles. Verbatim selected members only for Skills, Settings, Appearance, BankPinManager, EmoteManager, Properties, Entity, Player, Bank/EquipmentContainer, Location and ServerConstants. Recording adapters for quests, house, familiars/pets, music player, achievement diaries, pouches, POH storage, graves, autocast spells and content hooks; they hold getter values and record parser hand-offs, and do not model those systems. kotlinx.coroutines is a same-thread oracle stand-in. ServerConstants.JAVA_VERSION is fixed at 11; the script-engine pretty-printing branch, default-charset behaviour, a null save path, world login/logout wiring and concurrent saving are outside this corpus.",
